    "title": "Belmont: Man Shot at 4575 Park Ave, Condition Unknown - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By SÍLE MOLONEY ,\n2 hours ago Photo by Síle MoloneyPolice said a 21-year-old man has been shot in the the Belmont section of The Bronx. They said that on Wednesday evening, Oct. 22, at around 8.43 p.m., officers from the 48th Precinct responded to a 911 call regarding a man who had been shot in the abdomen, leg, and hand at 4575 Park Avenue. They said he was transferred to St. Barnabas Hospital by EMS and is expected to survive. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
